OL,3,GNEWSACharges could be imposed on peak
OL,4,Atime roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations choosing to carry out
OL,7,Froadworks at peak times could face a
OL,8,F#2,500 daily charge.
OL,10,FLincolnshire County Council said the
OL,11,Fmove was being considered as a way to
OL,12,Freduce disruption and get work finished
OL,13,Fmore quickly.
OL,15,FThe charges could be imposed on utility
OL,16,Fcompanies, developers and councils,
OL,17,Fwith a report stating the measure would
OL,18,F"encourage promoters to minimise the
OL,19,Fduration of works".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
