OL,3,GNEWSACharges could be imposed on peak
OL,4,Atime roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council's highways committee
OL,7,Fwill discuss the measure at a meeting
OL,8,Fon 2 November, and public consultation
OL,9,Fwill be carried out before a final
OL,10,Fdecision is made.
